<!-- pages/saved-list/saved-list.wxml -->
<!-- 我的保存结果列表: 展示已缓存的结果快照, 点击回看, 长按删除 -->
<view class="container">
  <!-- 空态 -->
  <view class="empty-state" wx:if="{{list.length === 0}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">📋</view>
    <view class="empty-text">暂无保存结果</view>
    <view class="empty-hint">生成分享卡时会自动保存结果，去试试吧</view>
    <view class="empty-btn" bindtap="onGoDecisionTree">去生成一份</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 结果列表 -->
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="list-header">共 {{list.length}} 条保存结果（最多保留 20 条）</view>

    <view
      class="result-card"
      wx:for="{{list}}"
      wx:key="id"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="onTapItem"
      bindlongpress="onLongPressItem"
    >
      <view class="card-title">{{item.headerTitle}}</view>
      <view class="card-plan">{{item.topPlanLabel}}</view>
      <view class="card-meta">
        <text class="meta-budget">预算 ¥{{item.budget}}</text>
        <text class="meta-time">{{item.savedTimeLabel}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="list-tip">长按可删除某条结果</view>
  </block>

  <!-- 项目仓库链接 -->
  <repo-footer />
</view>
